{"ID":"20240304090241-nauw4jz","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240304090241-nauw4jz","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240304090241-nauw4jz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312150022-ofg9f5r\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312150022-pv2l7at\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312150022-pv2l7at\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:64,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:64\u0026#125;","title":"【大陷胸丸】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312150022"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312150022-ofg9f5r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150022-ofg9f5r","updated":"20240312150022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第一百四十五条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150022-eydqoj4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150022-eydqoj4","updated":"20240312150022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「结胸」者,项亦强,如「柔痉」状,下之则和,宜「大陷胸丸」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150022-xo5yhv3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150022-xo5yhv3","updated":"20240312150022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"大陷胸丸方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312150022-qndcnpe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150022-qndcnpe","updated":"20240312150022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄半斤，葶历半升炒，芒硝半升，杏仁半升去皮尖熬黑。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312150022-o6e98g8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150022-o6e98g8","updated":"20240312150022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右四味,捣筛二味,纳杏仁、芒硝,合研如脂,和散。取如弹丸一枚,别捣甘遂末一钱匕,白蜜二合,水二升,煮取一升,温顿服之,一宿乃下；如不下,更服；取下为效；禁如药法。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312150022-479hikw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150022-479hikw","updated":"20240312150022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大黄、葶历、芒硝、杏仁这四味药是等量。把杏仁熬黑，再放下去。把大黄、葶历捣碎，纳杏仁、芒硝。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"杏仁里面有油脂，熬黑以后油会出来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，跟其他的药活在一起就像脂一样，黏黏一块。取如弹丸一枚,差不多一钱的量。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150022-wg276b4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150022-wg276b4","updated":"20240312150022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别捣甘遂末，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘遂末是生用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这里一钱你就是一钱。平常甘遂都是生用，甘遂去水力量非常强，几乎无水不去。“别捣甘遂末一钱匕,白蜜二合,水二升,煮取一升。”把甘遂跟白蜜煮在一起，温顿服之,一宿乃下；如不下,更服；取下为效。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150022-uzle8o3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150022-uzle8o3","updated":"20240312150022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄攻实。葶历祛痰。芒硝攻坚。杏仁温补肺，同时也能涤痰。葶历去水，其实痰水都可以去。杏仁比较趋向于涤痰。甘遂末排水力量很强。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312150022-0clzufn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150022-0clzufn","updated":"20240312150022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大陷胸丸，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大陷胸汤最主要症状结胸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。有小孩，胸前凸出一块出来，里面"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"可能被西医判定肺炎、肺积水、肺脓疡"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，有时候挺在胸口，有时候在中间。还有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"龟背，里面都是痰"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这都是陷胸汤症，所以大陷胸汤症，我们会用到甘遂、大黄、葶历、芒硝、杏仁，这种剂量下去的时候，都是能够把胸腔里面的痰水去掉。这个看起来是累积肺里面，不是在肺的下方，完全是痰水。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150022-pdouirz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150022-pdouirz","updated":"20240312150022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大黄去热，葶历去水，芒硝攻坚，芒硝不单单可以把硬便打散以外，老痰，结痰，非常硬的痰打散掉。芒硝攻坚，坚包含肿块，硬块在内。肺脓疡的时候会用，病人吃下去会大吐大下，隔夜吃完，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一宿乃下"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。下完整个胸部凹下去了。就是胸部凸出去，吃过陷胸汤会凹下去。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果没有下，再吃第二剂"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。甘遂药非常骏。如果体格比较小，剂量可以减一半。体格比较强壮的，用一钱都可以。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150022-7u7in8n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150022-7u7in8n","updated":"20240312150022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"跟白蜜煮过以后，甘遂的力量就比较缓，没有那么强。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150022-whsaeke","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150022-whsaeke","updated":"20240312150022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"结胸的原因，伤寒误下。实际上原因很多。可能他的感冒一直没有好，肺咳嗽痰累积起来，以后突然整个肺化脓样。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150022-pv2l7at","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150022-pv2l7at","updated":"20240312150022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"平常这些药不要做成丸剂，用的时候再去熬。杏仁火一烧就是黑的，一磨就变成杏仁霜。杏仁霜很粘，跟其他药混在一起，做成弹珠那么大一个。"}]}]}